  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Consider an array BBB of length MMM.\n\nThe beauty of BBB is defined as ∑i=1M∣Bi−BM+1−i∣\\sum_{i=1}^{M} |B_i-B_{M+1-i}|∑i=1M​∣Bi​−BM+1−i​∣.\n\nThe **score** of BBB is the **maximum** beauty over **all** permutations of BBB.\n\nYou are given positive integers NNN and XXX.\n\nFind the sum of **scores** of all arrays AAA of length NNN, such that 1≤Ai≤X1 \\leq A_i \\leq X1≤Ai​≤X.\n\nSince the sum might be large, please print it modulo 998244353998244353998244353.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and XXX — the number of elements in AAA and the maximum allowed value of AiA_iAi​, respectively.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line, the required sum, modulo 998244353998244353998244353.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤10001 \\leq T \\leq 10001≤T≤1000",
      "1≤N,X≤50001 \\leq N, X \\leq 50001≤N,X≤5000",
      "The sum of NNN over all testcases don't exceed 500050005000."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4\n2 3\n3 3\n4 5\n343 343",
        "output": "16\n72\n4832\n416089362",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: The arrays are:\n\n[1,1][1, 1][1,1]: Score of this array is ∣1−1∣+∣1−1∣=0|1-1| + |1-1|= 0∣1−1∣+∣1−1∣=0.\n[1,2][1, 2][1,2]: Score of this array is 222 since rearrangement [1,2][1, 2][1,2] has maximum beauty.\n[1,3][1, 3][1,3]: Score of this array is 444 since rearrangement [1,3][1, 3][1,3] has maximum beauty.\n[2,1][2, 1][2,1]: Score of this array is 222 since rearrangement [1,2][1, 2][1,2] has maximum beauty.\n[2,2][2, 2][2,2]: Score of this array is 000.\n[2,3][2, 3][2,3]: Score of this array is 222 since rearrangement [2,3][2, 3][2,3] has maximum beauty.\n[3,1][3, 1][3,1]: Score of this array is 444 since rearrangement [1,3][1, 3][1,3] has maximum beauty.\n[3,2][3, 2][3,2]: Score of this array is 222 since rearrangement [2,3][2, 3][2,3] has maximum beauty.\n[3,3][3, 3][3,3]: Score of this array is 000.\n\nThe sum of scores is 2+4+2+2+4+2=162+4+2+2+4+2 = 162+4+2+2+4+2=16."
      }
    ]
  },
